# Cross-origin isolation lets the in-browser speech model use WASM threads.
# "credentialless" keeps cross-origin fonts and the CDN working without CORP headers.
# No referrer: nothing about visits leaks to third parties, and Hugging Face
# refuses model downloads whose Referer is a *.workers.dev address.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
